# APL sources are LF-only and should be reported as APL by linguist.
# Deliberately scoped to APL paths rather than `* text=auto eol=lf`: the
# JavaScript side has files committed with CRLF, and a repo-wide rule would
# renormalise them into a large unrelated diff.
*.apl      text eol=lf
*.apl?     text eol=lf linguist-language=APL
*.dyalog   text eol=lf linguist-language=APL
